---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION, GITHUB_URL, LINKEDIN_URL, EMAIL } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={`About - ${SITE_TITLE}`} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<div class="about-page">
				<h1>About Me</h1>
				<div class="about-content">
					<p>
						I'm Pavel Luzanov, a senior frontend / product engineer based in Tokyo,
						Japan. I started in frontend engineering and built deep expertise in React,
						TypeScript, and UI architecture. Today my work spans product architecture,
						cross-surface delivery, and engineering practice — still with a frontend core.
					</p>
					<p>
						I work from the problem backwards: clarify the goal, assess domain and blast
						radius, choose a practical design, and ship across admin and creator web/mobile
						surfaces. Impact usually looks like architecture modernization, shared UI
						practice, and reliable release trains — not slide decks.
					</p>
					<p>
						I design AI-agent workflows for implementation and review: agents move fast on
						broad tasks while I keep boundaries, acceptance, and merge ownership clear.
						When the blast radius requires it, I go full-stack for a time-boxed slice;
						backend is a tool, not my standing identity.
					</p>
					<h2>Writing</h2>
					<p>
						Earlier engineering articles, linked at their original locations (I have not
						copied them here). The first two were published on my employer's tech blog
						at the time, so the text may have been edited by its editors.
					</p>
					<ul class="writing-list">
						<li>
							<a
								href="https://anymindgroup.com/news/tech-blog/12055/"
								target="_blank"
								rel="noopener">Modular approach on structuring front-end application</a
							>
							<span class="meta"> · Jun 2021</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<a
								href="https://anymindgroup.com/news/tech-blog/15373/"
								target="_blank"
								rel="noopener"
								>How to recognize repetitive patterns and optimize them with React Hooks</a
							>
							<span class="meta"> · Oct 2021</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<a
								href="https://medium.com/anymind-group/tech-blog-building-shared-components-library-with-radix-ui-f1435fdc89c8"
								target="_blank"
								rel="noopener">Building a shared components library with Radix UI</a
							>
							<span class="meta"> · Dec 2021</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<a
								href="https://medium.com/anymind-group/using-vite-as-a-full-chain-tool-of-developing-bundling-and-documenting-your-code-4e9a1d150a02"
								target="_blank"
								rel="noopener">Using Vite as a full-chain tool</a
							>
							<span class="meta"> · Mar 2022</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
					<p>
						Recent posts are on the <a href="/blog">blog</a>; 2017 learning notes are kept in
						<a href="/early-notes">Early notes (2017)</a>.
					</p>
					<p>
						Feel free to reach out if you'd like to collaborate or talk about engineering.
					</p>
					<div class="contact-links">
						<a href={`mailto:${EMAIL}`} class="btn btn-primary">Email Me</a>
						<a href={GITHUB_URL} class="btn btn-secondary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
						<a href={LINKEDIN_URL} class="btn btn-secondary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	.about-page {
		max-width: 700px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 2rem 1rem;
	}

	h1 {
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.about-content {
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		line-height: 1.8;
	}

	.about-content p {
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	h2 {
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		margin: 2rem 0 0.75rem;
	}

	.writing-list {
		padding-left: 1.25rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.writing-list a {
		color: var(--accent);
	}

	.meta {
		color: var(--gray);
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}

	.contact-links {
		display: flex;
		gap: 1rem;
		justify-content: center;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		margin-top: 2rem;
	}

	.btn {
		display: inline-block;
		padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
		border-radius: 8px;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-weight: 600;
		transition: all 0.2s ease;
		border: 2px solid transparent;
	}

	.btn-primary {
		background: var(--accent);
		color: white;
	}

	.btn-primary:hover {
		background: var(--accent-dark);
		transform: translateY(-2px);
	}

	.btn-secondary {
		background: transparent;
		color: var(--accent);
		border-color: var(--accent);
	}

	.btn-secondary:hover {
		background: var(--accent);
		color: white;
		transform: translateY(-2px);
	}
</style>
